{{header bosses}}
The '''Seven Deadly Sins''' are mini-bosses that can be encountered on any floor in their respective Mini-Boss rooms outside of The Chest and Dark Room. Unlike with bosses, there is no special door leading to a mini-boss room, meaning that there is no way to tell whether a room is inhabited by a mini-boss unless the player has an item that reveals map icons such as {{i|The Compass}} or a Map item. Once in a mini-boss room, the player cannot escape through means of bombing the door, as it will be boarded off. The Sins and Super Sins notably [[Stage HP|become tougher]] the later in the game they are encountered.

Each of the Sins has specific drops, that are consumables or a pedestal item (less frequently). In a room containing multiple Sins, only the last one will drop something, allowing you to choose what drop you want by killing a certain mini-boss last.

All of them are based on the [[wikipedia:Seven deadly sins|Seven Deadly Sins]].

