== Ultra Sins ==
There is an Ultra variant of both Pride and Greed. Ultra Pride resembles [[Edmund]] and [[Florian]], while {{e|Ultra Greed}} and {{e|Ultra Greedier}} serve as the final bosses for [[Greed Mode]] and [[Greedier Mode]] respectively.

